  *Abstract*

  The #link("https://paperpile.com/g/what-is-the-abstract-of-a-paper/", "abstract") is the overview of your thesis and generally very short. This section should highlight the main contents of your thesis “at a glance” so that someone who is curious about your work can get the gist quickly. Take a look at our guide on #link("https://paperpile.com/g/what-is-the-abstract-of-a-paper/", "how to write an abstract") for more info.

